        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana AN138, Rectangular Anvil Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Anvil Cabinet Knob is a stunning way to add a modern touch to your kitchen doors and drawers. It is amazing how simply changing your cabinet hardware can dramatically update your kitchen. This modern cabinet knob can be mounted vertically or horizontally. This rectangular cabinet pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. Select from a wide range of designer finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-AN138-specifications.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"600\" height=\"145\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana AN138 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the The Anvil Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Height: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Width: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Back Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>2 Locator pins to avoid rotation.</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-AN138-specifications.pdf?v=1691095331\"><b>Deltana AN138 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-AN138-installed.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"590\" height=\"299\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana AN138 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
