                "title": "Contemporary Anvil Cabinet Knob",
                "description": "The Contemporary Anvil Cabinet Knob is a stunning way to add a modern touch to your kitchen doors and drawers. It is amazing how simply changing your cabinet hardware can dramatically update your kitchen. This modern cabinet knob can be mounted vertically or horizontally. This rectangular cabinet pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. Select from a wide range of designer finishes.\r\n",
